---
import workflow from "../data/asset-to-scene.json";
---
<section id="workflow" class="container section-space" aria-labelledby="loop-heading">
  <div class="grid gap-6 border-t border-ink pt-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12">
    <h2 id="loop-heading">One asset. A kit. A place.</h2>
    <p class="max-w-reading text-dim">Look at the shuttered window above the shopfront. In this version of Seed Town, the same window bay appears {workflow.asset.instances} times across {workflow.scene.buildings} buildings.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="mt-8">
    <video class="aspect-video w-full bg-stage" controls muted playsinline preload="none" poster={workflow.media.poster} width={workflow.media.width} height={workflow.media.height} aria-label="A window bay in three finishes becomes a shop. Neighboring shops assemble floor by floor, streets fill out around the market square, and trees are planted outside Seed Town.">
      <source src={workflow.media.mp4} type="video/mp4" />
      <a href={workflow.media.mp4}>Watch the Seed Town film</a>
    </video>
    <figcaption class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-code text-dim"><span>Seed Town · daylight · seed {workflow.scene.seed}</span><a class="text-link" href={workflow.media.gif} download>Download GIF</a></figcaption>
  </figure>
  <ol class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8">
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <h3 class="text-title">One window bay</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">Choose stucco, brick or timber. Change the window shape, add shutters or add an iron balcony.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="/gallery/seed-town/facade-bay/">Inspect the window bay</a>
    </li>
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <h3 class="text-title">A nine-model kit</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">Fit the upper bays above a shopfront, cap them with a roof and hang a sign outside. The kit also supplies paving, lamps, street furniture and trees.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="/packs/seed-town/">Browse the nine models</a>
    </li>
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <h3 class="text-title">A town you can walk</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">Walk the high street to the market square. Enter another seed to build a different town from the same models.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="/scenes/seed-town/?seed=2026">Explore this town</a>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
